<urn:beads-cache:finding:C2-REQ-004> triage:startupEvidence "{\"finding\": {\"category\": \"correctness\", \"evidence\": \"Independent source-free public-API probe at45c9dd1 retains Composed::schedule_store(), starts its ordinary set_enabled write under a real external BEGIN IMMEDIATE writer and proves actual same-connection mutex contention via a bounded worker view notification. Then Application::start(grace250ms) and actual shutdown remain pending902.343541ms (>original2T500ms); after explicit writer ROLLBACK, management returnsOk(true), both probe/management threads join and Application returnsOk at978.142166ms. Direct probe process exited0 and was waited/reaped; no product edits/private access. Source cron171 warn_at_startup()->schedule.rows760 reads original management store before stop loop and deadlines200+.\", \"file\": \"crates/bd-cache-sync/src/cron.rs\", \"id\": \"RSH-001\", \"issue\": \"The qualified post-start worker/store correction is consumed correctly, but the public startup path still reads warnings through the unbounded management view before observing stop. A supported retained schedule view can hold that shared connection during an ordinary management write, extending an actual Application shutdown beyond2T before the bounded worker starts.\", \"line\": 171, \"owning_sprint\": \"c-1\", \"probe_receipt\": \"/tmp/phase-c-execution/c-2/qa-5/startup-probe-result.json\", \"recommendation\": \"Route this newly discovered startup occurrence to the C1 shared cron producer owner: make startup work stop-aware and cooperatively bounded within the existing absolute2T lifetime, preserving real owned joins and ordinary independent management policy. Add a deterministic early-stop/shared-connection regression. No new SDK surface, detached task, timeout widening or management-policy suppression is required by this finding. After the producer correction, consume the exact source and requalify the caller.\", \"reviewer\": \"rust-qa-agent\", \"scope_limit\": \"This is the generic public cron/start-stop contract and a real public Application API reproduction. Current stock daemon composition itself does not launch this independent pre-start same-connection management writer; no stock-daemon HTTP reproduction is asserted. Genuine post-start worker/store/reader caller qualification remains credited.\", \"severity\": \"critical\"}, \"owner_task\": \"/root/c2_rustqa4\", \"probe\": \"/tmp/phase-c-execution/c-2/qa-5/startup-probe-result.json\", \"qualified_shared_producer\": \"5255610a16ef4500f0af508e29a533707a4a3e0a\", \"scope\": \"New supported public Application/SystemSchedules startup occurrence owned by C1 cron prelude, no documented startup exclusion; stock daemon HTTP reproduction not claimed. Prior post-start fixes remain credited.\", \"source_commit\": \"45c9dd13258482ba8af3e5cfeae5ce146b120453\", \"status\": \"open\"}" .
